---
title: One search through the cache - a miss, then a hit; a booking raises the version (as built, P08)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Tool as tools/measure.py or curl
  participant API as api.find_free_rooms<br/>+ search_free_rooms
  participant Stats as Stats (GET /stats)
  participant Cache as AvailabilityCache<br/>-> RedisKeyValueStore
  participant Redis as Redis (copies, TTL 30 s)
  participant UoW as unit_of_work (main.py)
  participant BS as BookingService.find_free_rooms
  participant Count as CountingReservationStore
  participant DB as SqlReservationStore -> database (truth)

  rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
  Note over Tool,DB: Search 1 - a miss
  Tool->>API: GET /rooms/availability?checkIn=2026-11-12&checkOut=2026-11-14
  API->>Stats: add("searches")
  API->>Cache: lookup(2026-11-12, 2026-11-14) [thread pool]
  Cache->>Redis: GET availability:version
  Redis-->>Cache: nil -> version 0
  Cache->>Redis: GET availability:v0:2026-11-12:2026-11-14
  Redis-->>Cache: nil (miss)
  API->>Stats: add("cacheMisses")
  API->>UoW: in_unit_of_work (one connection)
  UoW->>BS: find_free_rooms(stay)
  BS->>Count: has_overlap(R7), has_overlap(R8)
  Count->>Stats: add("databaseQueries") x 2
  Count->>DB: 2 x SELECT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reservations WHERE room = ? AND status = Confirmed AND nights overlap)
  DB-->>BS: free: R7, R8
  API->>Cache: put(key, [R7, R8])
  Cache->>Redis: SET availability:v0:2026-11-12:2026-11-14 "R7,R8" EX 30
  API-->>Tool: 200 rooms R7, R8 - X-Cache: miss
  end

  rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
  Note over Tool,DB: Search 2 within 30 s - a hit: no unit of work, no database connection
  Tool->>API: GET /rooms/availability (same stay)
  API->>Cache: lookup(...)
  Cache->>Redis: GET availability:version, GET availability:v0:...
  Redis-->>Cache: "R7,R8"
  API->>Stats: add("cacheHits")
  API-->>Tool: 200 the same bytes - X-Cache: hit
  end

  rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
  Note over Tool,DB: A booking - decided by the database, never by the cache
  Tool->>API: POST /reservations (Maya, R7, 12-14 Nov)
  API->>UoW: in_unit_of_work: BookingService.reserve -> has_overlap, count, save (3 queries), then COMMIT
  API->>Cache: invalidate() - only after the commit, only for 201 (and 204 on DELETE)
  Cache->>Redis: INCR availability:version -> 1
  API-->>Tool: 201 R101
  Note over Tool,Redis: the next search builds availability:v1:... - a miss - and reads the truth
  end
